{"id": "62781", "title": "坏掉的玩偶", "author": "倩倩小", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 23, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/62/62781.htm", "intro": "囚笼禁裔是至亲妹妹，夺心夺身，欲孽兄弟誓要囚她一生\r\n\r\n小绵羊出生在黑暗、丑陋、肮脏之下的家庭中，仰望着囚笼外的世界，她知道自己是不被寄予幸福之人。\r\n\r\n一个坏了的玩偶是没有爱人与被爱的权利。\r\n\r\n命运也不过在那精美奢华的囚笼中挣扎几下，最终归附屈服。\r\n\r\n她是哥哥们的禁裔，\r\n\r\n被爱的权利是他们给予的，爱人的权利也是他们给予的。\r\n\r\n她所剩下的也不过是这具空虚破碎的躯壳而已。\r\n\r\n她给自己的最后一个赌注，策划一场完美的绑架案，赌他们会放弃那奢华的婚礼，然，等待她的却是手机里那冷漠的回答。\r\n\r\n于是她知道，她输了，输得彻底。\r\n\r\nPS:此文很黑暗，女主很软弱，人设很变态。剧情很扭曲，慎入...", "base": "files/article/html/62/62781", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "file": "9316640.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "file": "9316641.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三部分", "file": "9316644.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四部分", "file": "9316647.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五部分", "file": "9316649.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六部分", "file": "9316650.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七部分", "file": "9316651.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八部分", "file": "9316653.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九部分", "file": "9316656.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十部分", "file": "9316658.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11部分", "file": "9316662.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12部分", "file": "9316664.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "9316666.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "9316668.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15", "file": "9316672.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16", "file": "9316675.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17", "file": "9316677.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18", "file": "9316680.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19", "file": "9316682.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20", "file": "9316685.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21", "file": "9316686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22", "file": "9316688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23", "file": "9316690.html", "availa